@startuml obelisk_state_document
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 140
[*] --> NeverSaved : New
[*] --> Clean : Open
NeverSaved --> NeverSaved : edit (recovery copy, Should)
NeverSaved --> Saving : first Save
Clean --> Changed : edit, switch view
Changed --> Saving : Save or 30 s autosave
Saving --> Clean : complete file replaced
Saving --> Changed : timeout or error
Saving --> Conflict : file changed on disk
Conflict --> Saving : Overwrite / Save As
Conflict --> Changed : Cancel
Changed --> [*] : close, discard
Clean --> [*] : close
NeverSaved --> [*] : close, discard
note right of NeverSaved : Never autosaved (FR-14)
@enduml
